OL,3,GNEWSATaxi driver believes hidden agenda
OL,4,Abehind review
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Jersey taxi driver believes there is
OL,7,Fa hidden agenda behind a review into
OL,8,Fthe island's taxi service.
OL,10,FMick Tostevin, secretary of the Jersey
OL,11,FTaxi Drivers Association, said he did
OL,12,Fnot believe it was a coincidence that a
OL,13,Frepresentative from Uber - an online
OL,14,Fride requesting service - had come to
OL,15,Fthe island as it was announced the
OL,16,Freview was under way.
OL,18,FInfrastructure Minister Jonathan Renouf
OL,19,Fsaid "I want to make clear that there
OL,20,Fis no hidden agenda behind this
OL,21,Freview", adding he had not invited an
OL,22,FUber representative to the island.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
